Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 21:12:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 002/144] arm64: dts: qcom: integrate the Dodge board
 description

Consolidate the local USB/UFS/framebuffer/GPIO/PMK/key/touch board additions into one board DTS change.

Consolidated from local follow-ups:
  f3a3a4d14ebf3d5d0ce10ad228d7ae459261a184 arm64: dts: qcom: keep Dodge core and USB peripheral support minimal
  6eaeb32e96579ea4d5fe1f5545c77a1e6cf95ec0 arm64: dts: qcom: order Dodge USB properties before node deletion
  c5f7ea978a05cd36dca33c65720a48dcb0f1634c arm64: dts: qcom: enable Dodge UFS and its supplies
  5b3f466033d09bcf8c832799118b0fa5996e2bb0 arm64: dts: qcom: describe Dodge bootloader framebuffer and ramoops
  963344000d05c0449227b5f8318d94a6046ecb08 arm64: dts: qcom: restore Dodge secure GPIO reservations
  6e2d6c32a1e62f33e5f199d575f53862a2031bb2 arm64: dts: qcom: restore Dodge PMK8550 description
  6c58bd2551b5cd23685a32c8be86c0670fafcfa1 arm64: dts: qcom: restore Dodge physical key inputs
  414fabf3721649a0505c68ff8c28428c0f21e9b1 arm64: dts: qcom: restore Dodge S3910 touchscreen wiring
---
